  <ifrs-full:DisclosureOfClassesOfShareCapitalExplanatory contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">가. 회사가 발행할 주식의 총수는 300,000,000주이고, 당분기말 현재 회사가 발행한 보통주식수와 자기주식수(소각 주식수 제외)는 각각 158,437,008주(1주당 100원)와 9,138,491주입니다.</ifrs-full:DisclosureOfClassesOfShareCapitalExplanatory>
  <entity00266961:ShareCapitalAndCapitalSurplusTextBlockTextBlock contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">당분기말 현재 보통주자본금과 주식발행초과금은 각각 16,481,340천원, 132,920,605천원이며, 이익소각으로 인하여 발행주식 액면 총액은 15,843,701천원으로 납입자본금(16,481,340천원)과 상이합니다.</entity00266961:ShareCapitalAndCapitalSurplusTextBlockTextBlock>
  <ifrs-full:SharesInEntityHeldByEntityOrByItsSubsidiariesOrAssociates contextRef="CFY2025eFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfShareCapitalAxis_ifrs-full_OrdinarySharesMember" unitRef="SHARES" decimals="INF">9138491</ifrs-full:SharesInEntityHeldByEntityOrByItsSubsidiariesOrAssociates>
  <ifrs-full:SharePremium contextRef="CFY2025eFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-3">132920605000</ifrs-full:SharePremium>
  <entity00266961:ExplanationOfTheAcquisitionAndDisposalOfTreasuryStockTextBlock contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">나. 회사는 당분기 중 주식선택권 행사 등으로 자기주식 369,222주를 처분하였고, 자기주식처분이익 26,974백만원을 인식하였습니다.</entity00266961:ExplanationOfTheAcquisitionAndDisposalOfTreasuryStockTextBlock>
  <entity00266961:NumberOfTreasurySharesSoldUponExerciseOfStockOptionsOfExplanationOfTheAcquisitionAndDisposalOfTreasuryStockOfExplanationOfTheAcquisitionAndDisposalOfTreasuryStockTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" unitRef="SHARES" decimals="INF">369222</entity00266961:NumberOfTreasurySharesSoldUponExerciseOfStockOptionsOfExplanationOfTheAcquisitionAndDisposalOfTreasuryStockOfExplanationOfTheAcquisitionAndDisposalOfTreasuryStockTableOfItems>
